# T020：申请只返回共享请求元数据，不开放文件。申请者可以不是任务成员；已知固定版本UUID才能申请。
# 所有JWT和下载响应url只放本地私有REST环境，不提交/打印真实值。
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1
@applicantToken = REPLACE_LOCAL_APPLICANT_JWT
@approverToken = REPLACE_LOCAL_OWNER_DATA_APPROVER_JWT
@versionId = REPLACE_FIXED_VERSION_UUID
@newVersionId = REPLACE_NEW_FIXED_VERSION_UUID
@taskId = REPLACE_TASK_UUID
@clientRequestId = REPLACE_STABLE_REQUEST_UUID
@grantId = REPLACE_GRANT_UUID
@expectedLockVersion = 0
@requestedValidUntil = REPLACE_FUTURE_UTC_ISO_INSTANT
@validUntil = REPLACE_FUTURE_UTC_NOT_AFTER_REQUESTED

### 申请：任何两机构有效注册账号均可，reason非空白且<=1000；期限必须是未来UTC
# 重试沿用clientRequestId和相同内容；同键不同内容409 IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT。
POST {{baseUrl}}/access-grants
Authorization: Bearer {{applicantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"clientRequestId":"{{clientRequestId}}","versionId":"{{versionId}}","reason":"申请此固定版本用于巡检对比","requestedValidUntil":"{{requestedValidUntil}}"}

### 只查看自己的申请元数据；无filename/hash/task详情，不授予任务权限
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-grants?mine=true&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{applicantToken}}

### 审批队列：OrgA OWNER_DATA_APPROVER并且是该任务成员
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-grants?taskId={{taskId}}&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{approverToken}}

### 批准：精确版本必须已APPROVED+CONFIRMED；任务无需COMPLETED
# validUntil必填，未来且不晚于requestedValidUntil；CAS只允许一人决策。
POST {{baseUrl}}/access-grants/{{grantId}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{approverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision":"APPROVED","validUntil":"{{validUntil}}","expectedLockVersion":{{expectedLockVersion}}}

### 拒绝替代上面的批准，需使用仍PENDING的独立请求；reason必填，不能传validUntil
POST {{baseUrl}}/access-grants/{{grantId}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{approverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision":"REJECTED","reason":"本次申请不符合用途范围","expectedLockVersion":{{expectedLockVersion}}}

### 已获批且未过期时，只读取这个精确版本；同机构、ORG_ADMIN-only也遵循同一规则
GET {{baseUrl}}/evidence-versions/{{versionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{applicantToken}}

### SQL权限过滤发生在COUNT/LIMIT之前；无授权时列表为200空，详情为403
GET {{baseUrl}}/evidence-versions?taskId={{taskId}}&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{applicantToken}}

### 不会因旧版授权自动开放新版本或整个任务
GET {{baseUrl}}/evidence-versions/{{newVersionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{applicantToken}}

### 原文件实际核验，COPY请求仍沿用t013 multipart协议；历史也重新检查当前授权
POST {{baseUrl}}/evidence-versions/{{versionId}}/verifications?source=STORED
Authorization: Bearer {{applicantToken}}

### 签发短期下载地址，data={url,expiresAt}，Cache-Control:no-store
# URL有效期<=300秒且不超过授权剩余时间。实际GET地址在本地私密使用，不复制进文档/日志。
POST {{baseUrl}}/evidence-versions/{{versionId}}/download-url
Authorization: Bearer {{applicantToken}}

### 撤销：先从mine/task列表读取最新lockVersion，再填写；需仍有效APPROVED
# 撤销后不再签发新地址；之前已签发URL仍可能在原expiresAt前有效。
POST {{baseUrl}}/access-grants/{{grantId}}/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{approverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"用途结束，撤销此精确版本的共享访问","expectedLockVersion":{{expectedLockVersion}}}

# APPROVED到期由数据库时间派生EXPIRED，即使存储状态未重写也立即失权。
# 完整真实验收：python3 deploy/scripts/verify-sharing.py
